<title>UK: Iran tenders to buy one cargo white sugar -traders.</title>
<headline>Iran tenders to buy one cargo white sugar -traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran tendered to buy one cargo of white sugar for shipment between May 15 and June 15, European sugar traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Earlier this week Iran was reported to have bought one to two cargoes of white sugar for the same shipment period. Details of the price paid have yet to emerge.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
